    </p>
    <p>
      • SSRN: <span data-field="impact.ssrn_count">{{ impact.ssrn_count }}</span> papers, <span data-field="impact.ssrn_downloads">{{ impact.ssrn_downloads }}</span> downloads (Rank: <span data-field="impact.ssrn_rank">{{ impact.ssrn_rank }}</span>).
    </p>
    <p>
